{"hw":"ἀξία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀξία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀξία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-ιη,</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἄξιος</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">worth, value,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τῶν φορτίων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.196</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ τιμήματος τῆς ἀξίας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">623</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ ἀ. τοῦ δούλου</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">936d</span> </span>; then, simply, <b class=\"lex-tr\">money-value, price, amount,</b> <span class=\"gk\">κατ' ἀξίην ἑκάστου ἀδικήματος ἐδικαίευ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.100</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑποτελέειν ἀξίην βασιλέϊ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.201</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῆς ἀ. τιμᾶσθαι</span> estimate the penalty <b class=\"lex-tr\">at the real amount,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36b</span> </span>, cf. e; <span class=\"gk\">τὴν ἀξίαν τῆς βλάβης ἀπογράφεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">845e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">προσάπτειν ἑκάστῳ τῶν ἁμαρτημάτων τὴν ἀ. τοῦ πάθους</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">876d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μὴ κατ' ἀξίαν τῆς οὐσίας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.4.32</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σκοποῦμαι.. εἰ ἄρα ὥσπερ τῶν οἰκετῶν, οὕτω καὶ τῶν φίλων εἰσὶν ἀξίαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.5.2</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κατὰ τὴν τῆς ὀλιγωρίας ἀ.</span> according to <b class=\"lex-tr\">the amount</b> of his neglect, Decr. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.74</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ κατ' ἀ. ἰσότης</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">proportionate</b> equality, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1302a8</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ κατ' ἀ. ἴσον</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1301b30</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">παρὰ τὴν ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1122b29</span> </span>,al. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> of persons, <b class=\"lex-tr\">reputation, dignity,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.68</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.18</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.63</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ τῆς ἀρχῆς ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</ci